  "goal": {
    "kind": "prove_from_hypotheses",
    "parts": [
      {
        "lhs": "cos(alpha-beta)",
        "rhs": "(a**2+b**2-2)/2"
      },
      {
        "lhs": "tan((alpha-beta)/2)**2",
        "rhs": "(4-a**2-b**2)/(a**2+b**2)"
      }
    ]
  },
  "quotes": {
    "goal": "i) cos(α-β) = (a²+b²-2)/2; ii) tan((α-β)/2) = ±√((4-a²-b²)/(a²+b²))"
  },
  "note": "Part ii's ± statement is equivalent to the squared form tan²((α-β)/2) = (4-a²-b²)/(a²+b²), which is what is proved."
